1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:04,110
Grandpa, Ellen, Philip, Robbie, you and me.

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:09,280
That's six steaks.

3
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:11,830
Don't forget Susan.

4
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:15,210
Seven steaks.

5
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:18,870
Cooking dinner for the entire family is not so easy.

6
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:22,160
The shopping: the salad:

7
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:28,240
tomatoes, lettuce, cucumbers, and onions.

8
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:35,000
The main course: steak and potatoes.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,980
Richard, how much broccoli do I need for seven people?

10
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:42,610
Marilyn, I have to tell you something.

11
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:45,110
At today's exercise class...

12
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:48,640
Yes, Richard.

13
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:54,940
Well, I didn't really exercise.

14
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:55,810
I knew it!

15
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:59,520
I wanted to, but Jack Davis needed a photographer.

16
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,610
I'm sorry, Marilyn.

17
00:01:01,610 --> 00:01:03,720
I don't understand. Did you exercise or not?

18
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:06,610
No. Instead of exercising, I photographed the class.

19
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:08,050
And you didn't exercise?

20
00:01:08,050 --> 00:01:13,440
No.

21
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:18,800
There's another advanced class today at four o'clock.

22
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,500
We'll go together.

23
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:21,640
What about the bet?

24
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:30,050
Oh, the bet is still on, but you shop for the groceries.

25
00:01:30,050 --> 00:01:35,340
Remember, you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

26
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:39,520
You win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

27
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:42,640
Including Susan.

28
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:47,340
Four o'clock at the advanced exercise class. With me.

29
00:01:47,340 --> 00:01:48,030
Don't forget to breathe.

30
00:01:48,030 --> 00:01:49,120
Skip, hop, front.

31
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,340
Twist... again.... OK, now... scissors.

32
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:54,030
This is fun. It's a piece of cake.

33
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:56,400
Yeah. Just wait.

34
00:01:56,400 --> 00:02:02,570
5, 6, 7, go right, 1, 2, back,

35
00:02:02,570 --> 00:02:06,400
2, 3 , 1, 2, 3, pony, pony...

36
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:13,930
1, 2, 3, kick... 1, 2, 3, kick... pony.

37
00:02:13,930 --> 00:02:16,700
And twist, twist.

38
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:19,250
OK. Let's pick up the pace.

39
00:02:19,250 --> 00:02:21,450
How are you doing, Richard?

40
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:30,910
I can barely move.

41
00:02:30,910 --> 00:02:36,430
2, 3, 4, front. Now we're going to run it off.

42
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:38,320
Front... knees up, knees up.

43
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:41,990
OK. Finish off by jogging in place.

44
00:02:41,990 --> 00:02:43,870
OK. Keep those knees up.

45
00:02:43,870 --> 00:02:46,160
All right. That's it for today.

46
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:49,140
Thank you, everyone. See you next week.

47
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:51,970
Thank you, Jack, but no thank you.

48
00:02:51,970 --> 00:02:57,430
The advanced exercise class is not so easy, huh?

49
00:02:57,430 --> 00:03:04,740
No, no, you were right. I was wrong.

50
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:08,400
Come on, Richard. Get up. Let's go.

51
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:11,730
You have to cook dinner for the entire family.

52
00:03:11,730 --> 00:03:16,480
Marilyn, I'm exhausted. I can't move.

53
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:20,000
Oh, you'll do it. It's a piece of cake.

54
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:23,670
Excuse me, Richard, Marilyn.

55
00:03:23,670 --> 00:03:25,880
You are a terrific instructor, Jack.

56
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:28,820
Thanks. But I have a question.

57
00:03:28,820 --> 00:03:32,430
Is this your very first advanced aerobics class?

58
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:34,760
Yes, it is.

59
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:37,090
You are in great shape, Richard.

60
00:03:37,090 --> 00:03:39,000
Very few people last in this class

61
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:43,460
for the full hour the very first time.

62
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:47,480
It's true. You are in great shape.

63
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,680
Thanks!

64
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:51,680
I think we'll cook dinner together.
